      "tactic_notes": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><!--{cke_protected}{C}%3C!%2D%2D%20x-tinymce%2Fhtml%20%2D%2D%3E--><strong>Pauline(55)</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Village Baker】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Lesnimir village's baker, Loving wife of Grigoriy the Blacksmith, she has a loud personality, but is very kind and loving. As the person responsible for provisions in the village, she can't help but be concern about the well being of all the villagers</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Physical Strength</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Though not a fighter, Pauline is physically very strong, She enjoys Arm-Wrestling with Grigoriy, in which she never lose.&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Overfeeding</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">She has the habit of making too many breads and over feeding the villagers, She don't mind working hard because she knows that she'll get something in return for her effort. She is oblivious to this habit of hers</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Sole Provisioners</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Though not always, the villagers often look to her to handle matters regarding food, as such She has knowledge on every villager favourite dishes and preference.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>A Polar Bear..?!?</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Pauline likes having Putin stand at the store front as some sort of mascot, she thought it would be pretty shocking and funny to visitors to the village, and she thought that it would be a lasting impression on them.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>\"Roast Pork\"</strong>&nbsp;A dish deaturing&nbsp;succulent pork roasted to perfection alongside an array of root vegetables such as carrots, potatoes, and parsnips.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【View on Magic】</strong></p>\n<p>As a citizen of the Empire, Pauline hold a strongly dislike magic belief.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><em>After visitors see Putin</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"AHAHA! Surprised? That's Putin, he's my store mascot of sort, oh and he help me out in the kitchen too\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬&nbsp;\"Welcome to Pauline's bakery! Care for some slice? I'm sure you'll like it!\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Ah, too much bread, you say? Can't have that! But what's a baker to do when her heart insists on filling every belly in the village with warmth and sustenance?\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"Are you eating right? Sorry, I just notice that you're a bit thin. If so, feel free to take some of my pastries\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"Ah, don't worry about the payment, as long as people bellies are being filled, I can died a happy baker\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><em>About Pavel</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"That brat Pavel, is he eating enough? I swear that boy is thin to the bones!\"</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-cke-filler-webkit=\"end\" data-cke-temp=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>",
